<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia DMIB year net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia DMIB year net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  28.9     vs	25.2</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  9.6     vs	 8.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   420.8     vs     366.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    36.2     vs	31.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -	vs	  -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.0     vs	 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's DMIB Bhd makes tyres and other industrial products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
